| 1 | blocker | §4 paired-bootstrap contract: shared mask, one draw per replicate for Δ*/G*/R*, exclusion counts, ratio status incl. `improvement` and exact-zero draws, room bootstrap with multiplicities; tests 12–13 |
| 2 | blocker | §3 GPU 1 as primary backend (same class as exp_03); §7 probe = 17 room-spanning intact canonical batches; gate on the paired Δ itself plus per-sample limits; operation placement preserved; pins recorded; CPU = separate protocol unless it passes |
| 3 | should-fix | §1 R3 labels (pipeline sensitivity, GL "can amplify", no waveform ranking, windows to verify); §4 explicit `M` and `logspec_mad` definitions |
| 4 | should-fix | §4 T60 normalisation labels + absolute-seconds supplement from stored raw measures |
| 5 | should-fix | §7 controls with fresh inference and distinct ids incl. a nonzero repeat; tests 5 and 7 (nonzero-angle composition, audio unchanged, order invariance, restoration after exception) |
| 6 | should-fix | §3 `released_k1` relabelled "trained K = 8, evaluated K = 1", no exp_03 parity, K agreement check, P/E claim scoped to K = 8 |
| 7 | should-fix | §4 band = historical variability, context only; cylindrical SD for `cyl_k8`; no decision use |
| 8 | should-fix | §5 meta/identity contract (lengths, window, ordered ids, checkpoint/array/query-list sha256s, versions, `complete`), metrics computed from the saved arrays; tests 9–10; pinned files verified by the exp_03 record test |

